{"4180520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chambered", "steam_appid": 4180520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4913590], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHAMBERED </strong>is an online co-op adventure where an ever-changing cube maze puts your endurance to a test. In order to escape, you must work together, solve puzzles, avoid deadly traps, and use whatever you can find along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/d04ddf29e659f4187f81f3d7eb8e83c0.poster.avif?t=1787485803\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/d04ddf29e659f4187f81f3d7eb8e83c0.webm?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/d04ddf29e659f4187f81f3d7eb8e83c0.mp4?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE CUBE</strong><br>Each run dumps you into a new procedurally generated chamber filled with hidden dangers and secrets. You’ll need teamwork, timing, and sharp wits to survive, and even then, not everyone makes it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/aa26e8782a9294f72cf0e59ce4f1a1c0.poster.avif?t=1787485803\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/aa26e8782a9294f72cf0e59ce4f1a1c0.webm?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/aa26e8782a9294f72cf0e59ce4f1a1c0.mp4?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP CHAOS</strong><br>Play with your friends online. Communicate, coordinate, and choose whether you stick together… or betray one another when the pressure spikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/5dd474d56c04018e9d512f16b2be5dd7.poster.avif?t=1787485803\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/5dd474d56c04018e9d512f16b2be5dd7.webm?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/5dd474d56c04018e9d512f16b2be5dd7.mp4?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ITEMS &amp; ENCOUNTERS</strong><br>Find and use a wide variety of items to help you progress - some make escape easier, others might just start chaos with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/845047d0c23f756397926d89da528374.poster.avif?t=1787485803\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/845047d0c23f756397926d89da528374.webm?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/845047d0c23f756397926d89da528374.mp4?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE IT YOUR OWN</strong><br>Customize your character’s look with unlockable outfits and cosmetics earned through achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/7c0a31845be0812b6cbced17a7891dc1.poster.avif?t=1787485803\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/7c0a31845be0812b6cbced17a7891dc1.webm?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/7c0a31845be0812b6cbced17a7891dc1.mp4?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONE GOAL: ESCAPE</strong><br>Every session is a new challenge. Will you make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/87bceff3c6c3fc28fdcf116deb6d1f08.poster.avif?t=1787485803\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/87bceff3c6c3fc28fdcf116deb6d1f08.webm?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/87bceff3c6c3fc28fdcf116deb6d1f08.mp4?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op and single player modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully randomized chamber</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of traps to dodge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thematic room types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird Sci-fi machines that do things</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHAMBERED </strong>is an online co-op adventure where an ever-changing cube maze puts your endurance to a test. In order to escape, you must work together, solve puzzles, avoid deadly traps, and use whatever you can find along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/d04ddf29e659f4187f81f3d7eb8e83c0.poster.avif?t=1787485803\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/d04ddf29e659f4187f81f3d7eb8e83c0.webm?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/d04ddf29e659f4187f81f3d7eb8e83c0.mp4?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE CUBE</strong><br>Each run dumps you into a new procedurally generated chamber filled with hidden dangers and secrets. You’ll need teamwork, timing, and sharp wits to survive, and even then, not everyone makes it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/aa26e8782a9294f72cf0e59ce4f1a1c0.poster.avif?t=1787485803\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/aa26e8782a9294f72cf0e59ce4f1a1c0.webm?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/aa26e8782a9294f72cf0e59ce4f1a1c0.mp4?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP CHAOS</strong><br>Play with your friends online. Communicate, coordinate, and choose whether you stick together… or betray one another when the pressure spikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/5dd474d56c04018e9d512f16b2be5dd7.poster.avif?t=1787485803\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/5dd474d56c04018e9d512f16b2be5dd7.webm?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/5dd474d56c04018e9d512f16b2be5dd7.mp4?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ITEMS &amp; ENCOUNTERS</strong><br>Find and use a wide variety of items to help you progress - some make escape easier, others might just start chaos with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/845047d0c23f756397926d89da528374.poster.avif?t=1787485803\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/845047d0c23f756397926d89da528374.webm?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180520/extras/845047d0c23f756397926d89da528374.mp4?t=1787485803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE IT YOUR OWN</strong><br>Customize your character’s look with unlockable outfits and cosmetics earned through achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im